Manipulate forces on the molecular level to realign, rebalance, and synergize equipment you wear to your form and function.

The accuracy and damage of any weapon will act as if it were [13, 18, 22, 25, 28 (TL1-5; MP 100)] higher. (Mindstars cannot be manipulated in this way because they are already in an ideal natural state.)

Your total armour will increase by [11, 14, 17, 20, 22 (TL1-5; MP 100)] and your fatigue will decrease by [5, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5; MP 100)] for each body armour and shield worn.

The effects increase with your Mindpower.
